β) → α → Option.{v} β","unsafe":false,"value":151,"source":{"code":"/-- Internal implementation detail of the hash map -/\ndef Const.get? [BEq α] [Hashable α] (m : Raw₀ α (fun _ => β)) (a : α) : Option β :=\n  let ⟨⟨_, buckets⟩, h⟩ := m\n  let ⟨i, h⟩ := mkIdx buckets.size h (hash a)\n  buckets[i].get? a","start":472,"end":476},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}